#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.cs
msgid "Point the mount near the celestial equator/meridian with clear sky to the west or east. Sidralune rotates the RA axis three times, plate-solves each frame, finds the mount's rotation axis and reports how far it is from the refracted celestial pole. Works without a view of Polaris."
